{"id":"asistencia","lemma":"asistencia","pos":"noun","rank":2977,"glosses":["attendance (the state of attending)","audience (a large gathering of people listening to or watching a performance, speech, etc.)","assistance, aid, help"],"ipa":"/asisˈtenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"asistencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-asistencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"La asistencia es obligatoria.","en":"Attendance is mandatory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460916","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"mandatory","l":"obligatorio"}]},{"text":"Necesito asistencia médica.","en":"I need medical assistance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598098","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},null,{"g":"doctor","l":"médico"}]},{"text":"Su asistencia no es necesaria.","en":"Your attendance isn't necessary.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"necessary, requisite","l":"necesario"}]},{"text":"¿Cómo vas a justificar tu falta de asistencia?","en":"How do you account for your absence?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to justify"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"lack, shortage"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Vuestra asistencia influirá en vuestra calificación final.","en":"Your attendance will affect your final grade.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705591","words":[{"g":"yours","l":"vuestro"},null,null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"yours","l":"vuestro"},{"g":"rating"},{"g":"final"}]}]}